            <div xml:id="d561">

                <pb facs="0460" n="448" sameAs="frus:frus1942v04/pg448"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.0011 European War 1939/19000: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">President Roosevelt to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Poughkeepsie</hi>, N. Y.</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1942-01-07">January 7,
                        1942</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your cable from Childs, Tangier, number 4, January 5th. I am inclined to agree
                    with his suggestion about Orgaz. What can you work out on this.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>F[<hi rendition="#small-caps">ranklin</hi>] D. R[<hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">oosevelt</hi>]</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
